    "//": "Mid-Range Gas Gun - Assaulter. SCAR-H sized select-fire battle rifle in 6.5mm Creedmoor.",
    "description": "The MRGG-A, or Mid-Range Gas Gun - Assaulter, is a short-stroke gas piston battle rifle natively chambered in 6.5mm Creedmoor. Built around a SCAR-H-class receiver, it trades a touch of raw stopping power for a flatter trajectory, tighter groups, and softer recoil. A 16-inch barrel and select-fire trigger group make it handy enough for fighting at closer ranges. The barrel can be swapped for a .308 conversion barrel.",
