    "description": "The MRGG-S, or Mid-Range Gas Gun - Sniper, is the designated marksman variant of the MRGG platform. A heavier 20-inch match barrel, free-floated handguard, and a precision semi-automatic trigger group wring every bit of accuracy out of the 6.5mm Creedmoor cartridge, reaching well past the range of a standard battle rifle while keeping recoil mild. Like the Assaulter, its barrel can be swapped for a .308 conversion barrel.",
